\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Overview of VLA token compressibility. \textbf  {(a)}~The same robot observation produces qualitatively different token importance patterns through different vision connectors, quantified by the coefficient of variation (CV) of post-connector token norms. \textbf  {(b)}~Connector architecture determines pruning tolerance: independent connectors degrade gracefully, entangling connectors exhibit cliffs; task complexity amplifies the divergence. \textbf  {(c)}~A single forward pass CV diagnostic routes each architecture to an appropriate compression strategy.}}{2}{figure.caption.2}\protected@file@percent }
\providecommand*\caption@xref[2]{\@setref\relax\@undefined{#1}}
\newlabel{fig:teaser}{{1}{2}{Overview of VLA token compressibility. \textbf {(a)}~The same robot observation produces qualitatively different token importance patterns through different vision connectors, quantified by the coefficient of variation (CV) of post-connector token norms. \textbf {(b)}~Connector architecture determines pruning tolerance: independent connectors degrade gracefully, entangling connectors exhibit cliffs; task complexity amplifies the divergence. \textbf {(c)}~A single forward pass CV diagnostic routes each architecture to an appropriate compression strategy}{figure.caption.2}{}}
