\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {12}{\ignorespaces Per-layer attention entropy ratio for SmolVLA (16 layers), OpenVLA (32 layers), and $\pi _{0}$ (18 layers). SmolVLA and $\pi _{0}$ maintain near-uniform attention throughout, while OpenVLA progressively sharpens from 0.98 to 0.48. Despite similar entropy, SmolVLA and $\pi _{0}$ exhibit opposite pruning outcomes due to token importance heterogeneity (CV $= 0.314$ vs.\ $0.038$). X-VLA (entropy $= 0.614$, CV $= 0.151$) occupies an intermediate position, consistent with its threshold-graded pattern (onset at $k{=}0.85$).}}{25}{figure.caption.58}\protected@file@percent }
